OL,3,GNEWSAMan to be sentenced five years
OL,4,Aafter worker's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is due to be sentenced after the
OL,7,Fdeath of a construction worker more
OL,8,Fthan five years ago.
OL,10,FPeter Clifford, 63, formerly of Holland
OL,11,FRoad, Felixstowe, Suffolk, pleaded
OL,12,Fguilty to gross negligence manslaughter
OL,13,Fat a hearing in February.
OL,15,FWorker Dale Baker, 30, who was from
OL,16,FFelixstowe, sustained serious injuries
OL,17,Fwhile carrying out renovations on a
OL,18,Fhouse in Woodbridge on 15 December
OL,19,F2020, and died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
