OL,3,GNEWSAMan to be sentenced five years
OL,4,Aafter worker's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Newton hearing, which is a mini-trial
OL,7,Fand heard without a jury, is due to be
OL,8,Fheld on 15 September at Ipswich Crown
OL,9,FCourt, to establish the facts in the
OL,10,Fcase ahead of sentencing.
